1
00:01:37,850 --> 00:01:43,070
[Shadow Punisher]

2
00:01:43,120 --> 00:01:43,740
[Divine Constable Tally]

3
00:01:43,740 --> 00:01:45,950
[Episode 22]

4
00:02:17,000 --> 00:02:17,910
Your Highness!

5
00:02:18,000 --> 00:02:18,840
Li Si!

6
00:02:21,710 --> 00:02:22,520
Li Si.

7
00:02:24,430 --> 00:02:25,240
Jiuying?

8
00:02:28,000 --> 00:02:28,800
Aunt.

9
00:02:31,400 --> 00:02:32,600
What brings you here?

10
00:02:33,630 --> 00:02:35,590
She couldn't bear being idle at my place,

11
00:02:35,590 --> 00:02:36,470
so I brought her along

12
00:02:36,470 --> 00:02:37,430
to gain some experience.

13
00:02:37,430 --> 00:02:38,240
Come on.

14
00:02:39,000 --> 00:02:40,600
Let me take a good look at you.

15
00:02:43,000 --> 00:02:44,600
You've really changed a lot.

16
00:02:45,400 --> 00:02:46,190
Jiuying,

17
00:02:47,000 --> 00:02:47,840
now,

18
00:02:48,240 --> 00:02:49,329
you're more and more

19
00:02:49,329 --> 00:02:50,430
like a heroine.

20
00:02:51,840 --> 00:02:52,640
Aunt must have

21
00:02:54,030 --> 00:02:56,000
taken good care of you.

22
00:03:03,120 --> 00:03:04,430
Don't bother to look for them.

23
00:03:04,430 --> 00:03:05,660
Zhenzhu, Yan Cheng, and the others

24
00:03:05,660 --> 00:03:07,320
have set off for Gutan County.

25
00:03:10,560 --> 00:03:11,520
Gutan County?

26
00:03:13,080 --> 00:03:13,890
Has there been

27
00:03:13,920 --> 00:03:15,320
any major case recently?

28
00:03:17,150 --> 00:03:18,550
The Grand Heir Apparent.

29
00:03:18,560 --> 00:03:19,960
The Grand Heir Apparent?

30
00:03:21,430 --> 00:03:22,590
What happened to Ye?

31
00:03:22,710 --> 00:03:23,590
Don't fret.

32
00:03:23,840 --> 00:03:24,840
It's not a case.

33
00:03:25,310 --> 00:03:27,590
The Grand Heir Apparent is leaving
for the Golden Dragon Pavilion

34
00:03:27,590 --> 00:03:28,920
to pray for His Majesty.

35
00:03:31,150 --> 00:03:32,240
Aunt,

36
00:03:33,430 --> 00:03:36,000
the two remaining mural figures
of ancient Liluo Sect

37
00:03:36,000 --> 00:03:37,360
have yet to be found.

38
00:03:37,840 --> 00:03:39,100
At the thought of that,

39
00:03:39,240 --> 00:03:40,310
my heart is

40
00:03:40,590 --> 00:03:42,100
always unsettled.

41
00:03:42,190 --> 00:03:43,800
I know what's on your mind.

42
00:03:44,360 --> 00:03:46,030
I share your premonition.

43
00:03:49,240 --> 00:03:50,430
Just now, you mentioned

44
00:03:50,430 --> 00:03:51,690
Yan Cheng and Zhenzhu.

45
00:03:53,120 --> 00:03:54,520
Then what about Meng Rui?

46
00:03:55,310 --> 00:03:56,640
Did Meng Rui set out too?

47
00:03:59,560 --> 00:04:01,220
Since that incident of yours,

48
00:04:01,240 --> 00:04:02,710
Meng Rui has always locked himself up

49
00:04:02,710 --> 00:04:03,970
in the Winter's Haven,

50
00:04:04,430 --> 00:04:05,960
refusing to talk to anyone.

51
00:04:11,400 --> 00:04:12,190
As of now,

52
00:04:12,840 --> 00:04:13,960
Li San is dead.

53
00:04:14,800 --> 00:04:16,000
Zhou Yan from the past

54
00:04:16,430 --> 00:04:17,630
is also dead.

55
00:04:18,360 --> 00:04:19,890
The only one still alive now

56
00:04:20,240 --> 00:04:22,100
is Divine Constable Li Qingyang.

57
00:04:24,270 --> 00:04:25,070
Aunt,

58
00:04:26,600 --> 00:04:28,560
I'd like to go to Gutan County as well.

59
00:04:28,560 --> 00:04:29,560
I wish to join Yan Cheng, Zhenzhu,

60
00:04:29,560 --> 00:04:30,430
and the others

61
00:04:31,310 --> 00:04:33,430
to contribute to
the Divine Constable Bureau again

62
00:04:33,430 --> 00:04:35,490
and protect the Grand Heir Apparent.

63
00:04:36,240 --> 00:04:38,640
Divine Constable Qingyang, heed my order.

64
00:04:40,040 --> 00:04:41,560
Whatever you command, Chief.

65
00:04:41,560 --> 00:04:43,560
Quickly go to Gutan County to support

66
00:04:43,560 --> 00:04:45,430
two fellow Divine Constables in secret.

67
00:04:45,430 --> 00:04:46,830
No mistakes are allowed.

68
00:04:46,830 --> 00:04:47,630
Got it.

69
00:04:49,600 --> 00:04:50,950
Take Jiuying with you.

70
00:04:51,000 --> 00:04:52,630
She's a good fighter
who can serve tea

71
00:04:52,630 --> 00:04:53,960
and do all your bidding.

72
00:04:56,680 --> 00:04:57,480
Come here.

73
00:04:57,750 --> 00:04:59,390
Let me take a good look at you.

74
00:05:02,430 --> 00:05:04,030
You've grown much stronger.

75
00:05:05,240 --> 00:05:06,040
This is great.

76
00:05:09,680 --> 00:05:10,870
The holy water

77
00:05:11,040 --> 00:05:12,950
will bring my son back to health.

78
00:05:19,960 --> 00:05:24,670
[Golden Dragon Hall]

79
00:05:34,190 --> 00:05:35,560
The Golden Dragon Pavilion

80
00:05:35,560 --> 00:05:36,890
is indeed spectacular.

81
00:05:37,430 --> 00:05:38,240
Let's go.

82
00:05:48,830 --> 00:05:49,630
This must be

83
00:05:49,920 --> 00:05:51,450
the Dragon Pond holy water.

84
00:05:53,040 --> 00:05:54,920
It appears that kowtowing and praying

85
00:05:54,920 --> 00:05:55,930
are no longer enough

86
00:05:55,930 --> 00:05:57,850
to soothe the longing in people's hearts.

87
00:05:57,850 --> 00:05:58,790
Zhenzhu.

88
00:05:59,070 --> 00:06:00,000
Give me a moment.

89
00:06:00,950 --> 00:06:01,850
Sir,

90
00:06:02,040 --> 00:06:03,120
I'd like some holy water.

91
00:06:03,120 --> 00:06:03,920
Sure.

92
00:06:14,600 --> 00:06:16,800
Yan, I guess this trip is not in vain.

93
00:06:17,040 --> 00:06:18,240
What did you pray for?

94
00:06:19,510 --> 00:06:20,600
I said a prayer...

95
00:06:22,560 --> 00:06:23,860
for Li Qingyang.

96
00:06:25,830 --> 00:06:27,190
Don't people say

97
00:06:27,920 --> 00:06:29,650
that bad guys always live long?

98
00:06:30,430 --> 00:06:32,040
With the way he usually is,

99
00:06:32,430 --> 00:06:34,290
he wouldn't easily die, would he?

100
00:06:35,390 --> 00:06:37,050
I just prayed for him to always

101
00:06:38,720 --> 00:06:40,520
turn misfortune into blessing.

102
00:06:45,390 --> 00:06:46,190
Let's go

103
00:06:46,360 --> 00:06:47,430
take a look in town.

104
00:06:47,600 --> 00:06:48,240
Sure.

105
00:06:58,500 --> 00:07:02,430
[Chenwai Inn]

106
00:07:25,830 --> 00:07:27,760
Why are you staring at me like that?

107
00:07:28,560 --> 00:07:30,120
How did you know they were

108
00:07:30,560 --> 00:07:32,620
setting out to see the Golden Dragon?

109
00:07:34,120 --> 00:07:35,320
That was a no brainer.

110
00:07:35,630 --> 00:07:36,650
The Golden Dragon Pavilion

111
00:07:36,650 --> 00:07:39,240
is the destination
of the Grand Heir Apparent's trip.

112
00:07:39,240 --> 00:07:40,110
So they would surely

113
00:07:40,110 --> 00:07:41,640
scout out that place first.

114
00:07:45,190 --> 00:07:46,040
Careful.

115
00:07:47,830 --> 00:07:48,720
Jiuying,

116
00:07:49,190 --> 00:07:50,500
as the saying goes,

117
00:07:50,830 --> 00:07:53,630
experience beats youth,
and patience beats haste.

118
00:07:53,630 --> 00:07:54,630
When drinking tea,

119
00:07:54,630 --> 00:07:56,159
you should do it the way I do.

120
00:08:05,310 --> 00:08:06,600
Have them over for tea.

121
00:08:07,560 --> 00:08:09,160
I told you about it, didn't I?

122
00:08:09,390 --> 00:08:10,430
This time, we are

123
00:08:10,560 --> 00:08:11,800
on a secret mission.

124
00:08:13,040 --> 00:08:14,440
What is a secret mission?

125
00:08:15,260 --> 00:08:17,280
A secret mission means...

126
00:08:19,040 --> 00:08:20,510
we must know

127
00:08:20,750 --> 00:08:22,190
what they know.

128
00:08:22,430 --> 00:08:24,290
However, they don't necessarily

129
00:08:24,630 --> 00:08:26,310
have to know what we know.

130
00:08:27,800 --> 00:08:29,190
But I think

131
00:08:29,510 --> 00:08:30,920
Mr. Yan got thirsty.

132
00:08:34,030 --> 00:08:35,390
I saw him

133
00:08:36,030 --> 00:08:37,120
drinking water.

134
00:08:39,390 --> 00:08:41,150
That was the holy water
of the Dragon Pond.

135
00:08:41,150 --> 00:08:42,320
Mr. Yan must have

136
00:08:42,840 --> 00:08:44,120
drunk that for me.

137
00:08:45,960 --> 00:08:47,820
I guess he still has a conscience.

138
00:08:48,910 --> 00:08:50,630
What do we do next?

139
00:08:51,630 --> 00:08:52,550
Jiuying,

140
00:08:53,530 --> 00:08:54,790
before setting out for Gutan,

141
00:08:54,790 --> 00:08:57,320
what did the chief instruct you to do?

142
00:08:58,030 --> 00:09:00,890
To serve tea, fight for you,
and do all your bidding.

143
00:09:03,000 --> 00:09:05,350
Let me serve tea to you then.

144
00:09:07,720 --> 00:09:08,510
And you...

145
00:09:09,030 --> 00:09:10,610
shall do my bidding.

146
00:09:20,000 --> 00:09:20,910
Make way!

147
00:09:21,320 --> 00:09:22,580
All of you, move aside!

148
00:09:24,440 --> 00:09:25,300
Clear the path!

149
00:09:26,840 --> 00:09:27,720
Make way for us!

150
00:09:29,570 --> 00:09:31,830
[Xuanjie]

151
00:09:30,440 --> 00:09:31,150
Move aside!

152
00:09:31,830 --> 00:09:35,160
[Sui Bing, Commanding General
of Xuanjie Battalion]

153
00:09:35,560 --> 00:09:38,440
[Ji Xun, Lieutenant General
of Xuanjie Battalion]

154
00:09:39,630 --> 00:09:40,440
Get out of the way!

155
00:09:40,440 --> 00:09:41,200
It's him.

156
00:09:41,200 --> 00:09:42,840
What's he so arrogant about?

157
00:09:42,810 --> 00:09:46,550
[Xuanjie]

158
00:09:43,240 --> 00:09:44,440
Xuanjie Battalion

159
00:09:44,440 --> 00:09:45,390
lost two cities in a row

160
00:09:45,390 --> 00:09:46,720
last year on the northern border.

161
00:09:46,720 --> 00:09:48,320
Fortunately, the Third Prince took command

162
00:09:48,320 --> 00:09:50,520
at that critical time and got them back.

163
00:09:51,240 --> 00:09:52,600
If I were this general,

164
00:09:53,000 --> 00:09:54,240
I would've gotten so ashamed

165
00:09:54,240 --> 00:09:55,770
that I'd pack up and go home.

166
00:09:57,120 --> 00:09:58,440
What was His Majesty thinking,

167
00:09:58,440 --> 00:09:59,910
sending a defeated general

168
00:09:59,910 --> 00:10:01,910
to protect the Grand Heir Apparant?

169
00:10:02,030 --> 00:10:04,030
Maybe it wasn't His Majesty's idea.

170
00:10:04,240 --> 00:10:05,390
I heard from my father

171
00:10:05,390 --> 00:10:07,360
that Sui Bing, the commanding general
of Xuanjie Battalion,

172
00:10:07,360 --> 00:10:08,840
is an aide to the First Prince.

173
00:10:08,840 --> 00:10:10,360
By coming in person to pray,
the Grand Heir Apparent

174
00:10:10,360 --> 00:10:12,600
has brought much glory
to the Crown Prince.

175
00:10:12,600 --> 00:10:13,670
How could Prince Ding not seize

176
00:10:13,670 --> 00:10:16,000
this great opportunity
to show  filial piety?

177
00:10:16,000 --> 00:10:18,000
Prince Ding has been stripped
of his title and confined,

178
00:10:18,000 --> 00:10:19,480
but he surely won't yield.

179
00:10:19,510 --> 00:10:22,570
I bet he facilitated this arrangement
by secret means.

180
00:10:23,150 --> 00:10:24,260
Are you suggesting

181
00:10:24,790 --> 00:10:26,390
that His Majesty intends

182
00:10:26,390 --> 00:10:28,390
to help the First Prince rise again?

183
00:10:29,200 --> 00:10:30,530
It can be a possibility.

184
00:10:30,870 --> 00:10:31,550
Look,

185
00:10:31,550 --> 00:10:33,030
it's His Highness Prince Ping!

186
00:10:33,030 --> 00:10:34,750
Your Highness Prince Ping!

187
00:10:34,840 --> 00:10:37,440
Your Highness Prince Ping!

188
00:10:37,460 --> 00:10:39,960
Your Highness Prince Ping!

189
00:10:37,610 --> 00:10:40,890
[Zhou Zhu, Prince Ping,
the Third Prince of Great Shi]

190
00:10:39,980 --> 00:10:43,490
Your Highness Prince Ping!

191
00:10:45,650 --> 00:10:47,170
Your Highness Prince Ping!

192
00:10:47,170 --> 00:10:48,560
Your Highness Prince Ping!

193
00:10:48,560 --> 00:10:50,030
Your Highness Prince Ping!

194
00:10:50,030 --> 00:10:51,760
Your Highness! Your Highness!

195
00:10:51,790 --> 00:10:52,990
Your Highness!

196
00:10:53,020 --> 00:10:54,230
It's been a long time,

197
00:10:56,000 --> 00:10:57,930
-Zhu.
-Your Highness Prince Ping!

198
00:10:58,720 --> 00:11:00,250
Your Highness Prince Ping!

199
00:11:01,260 --> 00:11:03,390
His Highness Prince Ping has arrived.

200
00:11:04,230 --> 00:11:06,920
Your Highness Prince Ping!

201
00:11:08,750 --> 00:11:09,910
Your Highness Prince Ping!

202
00:11:09,420 --> 00:11:10,810
[Xuanjie]

203
00:11:17,410 --> 00:11:18,360
General Sui.

204
00:11:22,630 --> 00:11:23,960
Your Highness Prince Ping,

205
00:11:23,960 --> 00:11:25,150
fancy meeting you here.

206
00:11:25,150 --> 00:11:26,110
I thought you were

207
00:11:26,110 --> 00:11:27,510
waiting outside the city

208
00:11:28,210 --> 00:11:29,290
for His Highness

209
00:11:29,320 --> 00:11:32,320
the Grand Heir Apparent's arrival.

210
00:11:33,840 --> 00:11:35,340
The order I received

211
00:11:35,550 --> 00:11:36,750
is to station at Gutan

212
00:11:36,790 --> 00:11:38,150
and eliminate hidden dangers.

213
00:11:38,150 --> 00:11:39,750
Gutan County is vast.

214
00:11:39,770 --> 00:11:41,140
Just suit yourself.

215
00:11:41,550 --> 00:11:42,840
Station wherever

216
00:11:42,840 --> 00:11:43,790
you like.

217
00:11:44,510 --> 00:11:45,960
The order I received is to

218
00:11:46,510 --> 00:11:48,710
safeguard the Golden Dragon Pavilion.

219
00:11:48,750 --> 00:11:49,840
Now it seems

220
00:11:49,920 --> 00:11:50,920
you and I

221
00:11:51,030 --> 00:11:52,430
each have our own duties.

222
00:11:52,630 --> 00:11:54,690
What do you mean by that, General Sui?

223
00:11:56,150 --> 00:11:57,910
Just what it literally means.

224
00:12:00,150 --> 00:12:02,080
Isn't that Sui Bing, a subordinate

225
00:12:02,120 --> 00:12:04,440
of my eldest brother,
who leapt three ranks overnight

226
00:12:04,440 --> 00:12:07,300
and was bestowed with
the title of General Huaihua?

227
00:12:07,910 --> 00:12:09,600
He's merely a defeated general.

228
00:12:09,600 --> 00:12:10,620
What right does he

229
00:12:10,650 --> 00:12:12,210
have to challenge Zhu?

230
00:12:13,550 --> 00:12:15,800
If my memory serves me right,

231
00:12:16,120 --> 00:12:17,990
the Golden Dragon Pavilion

232
00:12:18,240 --> 00:12:19,640
is at the end of this road.

233
00:12:19,840 --> 00:12:20,630
General,

234
00:12:21,670 --> 00:12:22,480
you're right.

235
00:12:23,550 --> 00:12:24,410
Your Highness,

236
00:12:24,630 --> 00:12:26,440
I shall take my leave.

237
00:12:54,320 --> 00:12:55,120
Let's go.

238
00:13:15,350 --> 00:13:18,710
[Changlai Steamed Bun Shop]

239
00:13:19,150 --> 00:13:21,080
Tanghulu!

240
00:13:27,200 --> 00:13:28,360
What are you looking at?

241
00:13:28,360 --> 00:13:30,240
Tanghulu!

242
00:13:31,630 --> 00:13:33,150
From what we've seen along the way,

243
00:13:33,150 --> 00:13:34,780
the people in Gutan County

244
00:13:34,910 --> 00:13:36,670
dwell in peace and contentment.

245
00:13:36,670 --> 00:13:38,150
The area is bustling with activity.

246
00:13:38,150 --> 00:13:39,600
And this main street

247
00:13:39,600 --> 00:13:40,960
is absolutely buzzing.

248
00:13:40,960 --> 00:13:42,550
-Gui. Gui!
-But look at this shop.

249
00:13:42,550 --> 00:13:43,200
Don't go in there.

250
00:13:43,200 --> 00:13:44,150
Someone died inside.

251
00:13:44,150 --> 00:13:45,290
Let's leave now!

252
00:13:48,390 --> 00:13:49,440
Zhenzhu, you see,

253
00:13:50,150 --> 00:13:52,120
the threshold of the shop
is severely worn.

254
00:13:52,120 --> 00:13:53,030
This means

255
00:13:53,030 --> 00:13:54,630
there were usually many people
coming and going.

256
00:13:53,350 --> 00:13:55,790
[Changlai Steamed Bun Shop]

257
00:13:54,630 --> 00:13:56,000
The business must've been good.

258
00:13:56,000 --> 00:13:56,960
But why is it

259
00:13:56,990 --> 00:13:58,320
so quiet today?

260
00:13:58,630 --> 00:14:00,000
Plus what happened just now...

261
00:14:00,000 --> 00:14:01,200
Look at these passers-by.

262
00:14:01,040 --> 00:14:02,710
[Changlai Steamed Bun Shop]

263
00:14:01,510 --> 00:14:02,750
They look at this shop

264
00:14:02,750 --> 00:14:04,390
as if it were a den of plague.

265
00:14:04,600 --> 00:14:05,800
Don't you find it odd?

266
00:14:06,910 --> 00:14:08,320
Impressive, Yan.

267
00:14:08,840 --> 00:14:10,300
You really are something.

268
00:14:10,360 --> 00:14:11,030
Let's go

269
00:14:11,030 --> 00:14:11,750
and take a look.

270
00:14:11,750 --> 00:14:12,440
Sure.

271
00:14:15,840 --> 00:14:17,990
My Lords! My Lords!

272
00:14:19,200 --> 00:14:20,490
My Lords.

273
00:14:19,300 --> 00:14:21,710
[Changlai Steamed Bun Shop]

274
00:14:20,960 --> 00:14:23,960
I am Du Zhongtao,
Magistrate of Gutan County.

275
00:14:23,960 --> 00:14:25,790
The two of you have
an extraordinary bearing.

276
00:14:25,790 --> 00:14:28,600
May I ask if you are from Tianhuang City?

277
00:14:30,840 --> 00:14:32,320
Within half a day of our arrival,

278
00:14:32,320 --> 00:14:34,180
someone's already calling on us.

279
00:14:34,630 --> 00:14:36,000
We are both head constables

280
00:14:36,000 --> 00:14:38,030
of the Divine Constable Bureau
in Tianhuang City.

281
00:14:38,030 --> 00:14:39,320
This is Constable Frost.

282
00:14:39,320 --> 00:14:41,180
We are here on official business.

283
00:14:41,600 --> 00:14:43,530
As it turns out, you are two

284
00:14:43,560 --> 00:14:44,870
of the renowned Divine Constables.

285
00:14:44,870 --> 00:14:45,720
To think that two

286
00:14:45,720 --> 00:14:48,390
out of the four Divine Constables
are present in person,

287
00:14:48,390 --> 00:14:49,720
I am utterly terrified.

288
00:14:49,840 --> 00:14:51,790
We are just here on official business.

289
00:14:51,790 --> 00:14:53,650
What are you terrified of, Mr. Du?

290
00:14:55,000 --> 00:14:57,600
The royals have repeatedly granted grace

291
00:14:57,600 --> 00:14:59,340
on our tiny Gutan County.

292
00:14:59,440 --> 00:15:02,320
Soon, the Grand Heir Apparent will arrive.

293
00:15:02,510 --> 00:15:03,390
And now we have received

294
00:15:03,390 --> 00:15:05,320
the two lords of you
from the Imperial City.

295
00:15:05,320 --> 00:15:07,120
How can I, as the magistrate here,

296
00:15:07,120 --> 00:15:08,600
not be terrified?

297
00:15:11,200 --> 00:15:12,200
My Lords,

298
00:15:12,360 --> 00:15:13,960
are you hungry?

299
00:15:14,030 --> 00:15:16,200
Why not follow me to the county office?

300
00:15:16,200 --> 00:15:17,960
I will prepare some wine

301
00:15:18,000 --> 00:15:19,600
as a gesture of hospitality.

302
00:15:21,120 --> 00:15:22,000
This bun shop seems fine.

303
00:15:22,000 --> 00:15:23,000
So, don't bother.

304
00:15:23,360 --> 00:15:24,310
My Lords!

305
00:15:24,630 --> 00:15:25,690
What's this about?

306
00:15:47,320 --> 00:15:49,550
You filthy scoundrels!

307
00:15:49,960 --> 00:15:51,310
You're vile and rotten to the core!

308
00:15:51,310 --> 00:15:52,720
None of you are any good!

309
00:15:54,510 --> 00:15:55,780
Take off

310
00:15:55,910 --> 00:15:57,770
the human skin you're wearing

311
00:15:58,000 --> 00:15:59,080
already

312
00:15:59,240 --> 00:16:00,640
and show your true forms!

313
00:16:06,600 --> 00:16:07,390
Listen!

314
00:16:07,960 --> 00:16:09,910
The shadow puppet ghost is here.

315
00:16:10,630 --> 00:16:12,940
Maybe you should all be killed,

316
00:16:13,200 --> 00:16:15,510
have your hearts and livers cut out,

317
00:16:15,790 --> 00:16:17,580
and return to the origin!

318
00:16:17,750 --> 00:16:18,810
You crazy cripple,

319
00:16:18,830 --> 00:16:20,240
what's that nonsense about?

320
00:16:20,240 --> 00:16:21,090
Zhao Quan!

321
00:16:21,270 --> 00:16:21,960
Yes!

322
00:16:21,960 --> 00:16:22,630
Shut up!

323
00:16:22,630 --> 00:16:23,360
Go after him!

324
00:16:23,360 --> 00:16:24,280
Catch him!

325
00:16:27,000 --> 00:16:28,020
Catch him!

326
00:16:32,430 --> 00:16:33,630
How dare you bite me!

327
00:16:33,630 --> 00:16:34,750
Go after him!

328
00:16:34,750 --> 00:16:35,510
Stop!

329
00:16:36,600 --> 00:16:37,600
What's there to see?

330
00:16:37,600 --> 00:16:38,200
Move aside!

331
00:16:38,200 --> 00:16:39,030
Mr. Du,

332
00:16:39,630 --> 00:16:41,830
What's that shadow puppet ghost about?

333
00:16:42,000 --> 00:16:42,840
Just...

334
00:16:43,550 --> 00:16:46,000
some rumors among the people.

335
00:16:46,150 --> 00:16:47,280
Not credible at all.

336
00:16:49,120 --> 00:16:50,250
But there's no smoke

337
00:16:50,440 --> 00:16:51,630
without fire.

338
00:16:52,910 --> 00:16:54,000
Mr. Du, right?

339
00:16:54,960 --> 00:16:55,750
Let's go.

340
00:16:56,360 --> 00:16:57,960
Bring us to the county office

341
00:16:58,840 --> 00:17:00,700
and explain this matter clearly.

342
00:17:07,440 --> 00:17:08,240
Jiuying,

343
00:17:08,589 --> 00:17:09,589
is this the place?

344
00:17:10,240 --> 00:17:12,200
I saw Zhenzhu and Mr. Yan attempt

345
00:17:12,150 --> 00:17:13,500
[Changlai Steamed Bun Shop]

346
00:17:12,200 --> 00:17:13,260
to enter this shop.

347
00:17:13,720 --> 00:17:14,579
Let's go inside

348
00:17:14,750 --> 00:17:15,800
for a look.

349
00:17:23,349 --> 00:17:24,160
Sir,

350
00:17:24,160 --> 00:17:25,440
take a seat, please.

351
00:17:25,550 --> 00:17:26,349
Sir,

352
00:17:27,000 --> 00:17:27,780
why aren't there

353
00:17:27,780 --> 00:17:29,600
any customers in your shop?

354
00:17:30,400 --> 00:17:31,200
There are.

355
00:17:31,200 --> 00:17:32,560
Who says there's no customer?

356
00:17:32,560 --> 00:17:33,830
A group of them just left.

357
00:17:33,830 --> 00:17:34,640
It's just a coincidence

358
00:17:34,640 --> 00:17:36,200
that there are no one else here now.

359
00:17:36,200 --> 00:17:36,920
This is perfect

360
00:17:36,920 --> 00:17:38,980
for you to enjoy peace and quietness.

361
00:17:41,000 --> 00:17:42,460
But everything seems cold

362
00:17:42,830 --> 00:17:44,030
in your shop.

363
00:17:44,160 --> 00:17:46,240
There isn't even a hint of cooking fire.

364
00:17:46,240 --> 00:17:48,170
Obviously, nobody has dined here.

365
00:17:48,920 --> 00:17:49,860
Could this shop

366
00:17:50,590 --> 00:17:52,590
of yours be a crooked establishment

367
00:17:52,830 --> 00:17:54,360
that no one dares to come to?

368
00:17:56,830 --> 00:17:58,110
Hey, mister,

369
00:17:58,750 --> 00:18:00,030
are you here to eat

370
00:18:00,030 --> 00:18:01,270
or to trash the place?

371
00:18:01,310 --> 00:18:02,200
I'd rather not

372
00:18:02,310 --> 00:18:03,510
do business with you.

373
00:18:03,550 --> 00:18:04,350
Please leave.

374
00:18:04,550 --> 00:18:05,350
Sir,

375
00:18:06,530 --> 00:18:07,590
I was just kidding.

376
00:18:07,640 --> 00:18:08,770
Please don't be mad.

377
00:18:09,350 --> 00:18:10,160
Jiuying,

378
00:18:10,160 --> 00:18:10,880
sit down.

379
00:18:13,720 --> 00:18:15,510
Whatever kinds of buns you have in here,

380
00:18:15,510 --> 00:18:16,800
serve them all.

381
00:18:17,750 --> 00:18:18,640
Yin Xiaoshan.

382
00:18:20,730 --> 00:18:21,570
Yin Xiaoshan!

383
00:18:22,440 --> 00:18:23,440
Yin Xiaoshan!

384
00:18:27,190 --> 00:18:29,220
You lazy bones,

385
00:18:29,350 --> 00:18:30,590
Am I paying you

386
00:18:30,620 --> 00:18:32,030
to enjoy yourself here?

387
00:18:32,200 --> 00:18:33,440
Get up right now!

388
00:18:36,400 --> 00:18:37,830
Serve buns to the guests!

389
00:18:38,030 --> 00:18:39,200
Boss,

390
00:18:39,310 --> 00:18:40,830
all your employees ran away.

391
00:18:40,830 --> 00:18:41,660
I came to help

392
00:18:41,690 --> 00:18:42,830
only out of pity.

393
00:18:43,310 --> 00:18:44,240
Speak nonsense again,

394
00:18:44,240 --> 00:18:45,770
and I'll deduct your wages!

395
00:18:50,550 --> 00:18:52,810
You think I care about that little money?

396
00:18:52,830 --> 00:18:53,580
It is known to all

397
00:18:53,580 --> 00:18:55,110
that I, Master Xiaoshan
of the Golden Dragon Pavilion, am

398
00:18:55,110 --> 00:18:58,570
brave and wise, even with the capability
of holding up the sky.

399
00:18:59,830 --> 00:19:00,590
Jiuying.

400
00:19:01,000 --> 00:19:02,200
we're in luck.

401
00:19:04,830 --> 00:19:05,640
Dig in.

402
00:19:06,240 --> 00:19:07,240
Master Xiaoshan.

403
00:19:08,400 --> 00:19:09,510
To be honest,

404
00:19:09,920 --> 00:19:11,780
Working in a small shop like this,

405
00:19:11,960 --> 00:19:13,000
even if you put up with

406
00:19:13,000 --> 00:19:14,260
all that humiliation,

407
00:19:14,720 --> 00:19:16,350
you still won't earn much.

408
00:19:16,590 --> 00:19:18,110
Judging from what you just said,

409
00:19:18,110 --> 00:19:20,440
it seems you have a post
in the Golden Dragon Pavilion.

410
00:19:20,440 --> 00:19:23,110
I wonder if you, Master Xiaoshan, have

411
00:19:23,350 --> 00:19:25,160
any connections in the pavilion.

412
00:19:25,160 --> 00:19:26,350
Who are you?

413
00:19:26,960 --> 00:19:28,110
Why ask about that?

414
00:19:30,000 --> 00:19:31,200
To tell you the truth,

415
00:19:31,480 --> 00:19:32,270
my name is

416
00:19:33,110 --> 00:19:34,230
Li Xiaosi,

417
00:19:34,440 --> 00:19:36,110
and I'm hoping to earn a position

418
00:19:36,110 --> 00:19:37,750
in the Golden Dragon Pavilion.

419
00:19:37,750 --> 00:19:40,510
I long for your instructions,
Master Xiaoshan.

420
00:19:39,310 --> 00:19:42,370
[Great Shi Treasure Notes]

421
00:19:41,720 --> 00:19:43,030
This is just a small gift

422
00:19:43,030 --> 00:19:44,310
to show my sincerity.

423
00:19:44,550 --> 00:19:45,750
Once it's done,

424
00:19:46,000 --> 00:19:47,320
I'll reward you handsomely.

425
00:19:47,320 --> 00:19:48,910
[Great Shi Treasure Notes]

426
00:19:50,110 --> 00:19:50,920
That's easy.

427
00:19:50,920 --> 00:19:51,920
No sweat at all.

428
00:19:53,350 --> 00:19:54,350
Listen,

429
00:19:54,510 --> 00:19:56,960
there is a department of food affairs
in the pavilion.

430
00:19:56,960 --> 00:19:58,160
It's the most

431
00:19:58,200 --> 00:19:59,790
crucial place in there.

432
00:20:00,030 --> 00:20:02,630
Many people are dying to get in
but still can't.

433
00:20:02,720 --> 00:20:03,690
Does it mean

434
00:20:04,000 --> 00:20:05,260
you have a way in for me?

435
00:20:05,350 --> 00:20:08,030
As long as you're not stingy
with treasure notes,

436
00:20:08,030 --> 00:20:10,000
Mr. Li, just leave the task to me.

437
00:20:15,400 --> 00:20:16,200
Enjoy!

438
00:20:18,590 --> 00:20:19,440
Jiuying.

439
00:20:20,590 --> 00:20:21,720
Go to the county office now

440
00:20:21,720 --> 00:20:22,980
to do something for me.

441
00:20:23,950 --> 00:20:27,190
[Gutan County Government]

442
00:20:24,790 --> 00:20:25,590
What?

443
00:20:25,720 --> 00:20:27,240
Nine people were killed?

444
00:20:27,590 --> 00:20:28,400
Du Zhongtao!

445
00:20:29,000 --> 00:20:30,330
What kind of magistrate

446
00:20:30,340 --> 00:20:31,030
are you?

447
00:20:31,160 --> 00:20:32,270
You are concealing facts of crimes.

448
00:20:32,270 --> 00:20:34,130
Don't you know the consequences?

449
00:20:37,160 --> 00:20:38,460
Why didn't you report

450
00:20:38,590 --> 00:20:39,990
such a magnificent case?

451
00:20:40,110 --> 00:20:42,070
The Grand Heir Apparent will arrive soon.

452
00:20:42,070 --> 00:20:43,530
How dare I report the case?

453
00:20:43,640 --> 00:20:45,400
If it delays the blessing ceremony

454
00:20:45,400 --> 00:20:46,790
and affects His Majesty's health,

455
00:20:46,790 --> 00:20:47,830
I can't bear the blame

456
00:20:47,830 --> 00:20:49,290
of such a monstrous crime.

457
00:20:51,000 --> 00:20:52,440
Is there any progress
on the investigation?

458
00:20:52,440 --> 00:20:53,400
No, none at all.

459
00:20:54,070 --> 00:20:54,830
Fine then.

460
00:20:54,830 --> 00:20:55,640
Du Zhongtao,

461
00:20:55,720 --> 00:20:56,980
be seated. Don't move.

462
00:20:58,310 --> 00:20:59,070
You useless official,

463
00:20:59,070 --> 00:21:00,110
-I'll kill you! You believe that?
-Yan, Yan!

464
00:21:00,110 --> 00:21:00,550
Yan!

465
00:21:00,550 --> 00:21:01,160
It's not like that.

466
00:21:01,160 --> 00:21:02,960
I wish I could do something.

467
00:21:02,960 --> 00:21:03,830
But the case

468
00:21:03,830 --> 00:21:05,240
was not done by humans,

469
00:21:05,310 --> 00:21:07,510
so it certainly can't be solved
by human power.

470
00:21:07,510 --> 00:21:08,710
What did you just say?

471
00:21:09,310 --> 00:21:10,480
As an official of the imperial court,

472
00:21:10,480 --> 00:21:11,590
you actually believe such nonsense

473
00:21:11,590 --> 00:21:13,400
instead of conducting
a thorough investigation!

474
00:21:13,400 --> 00:21:14,110
I think you just

475
00:21:14,110 --> 00:21:15,830
made all that gibberish up
to shirk your responsibility

476
00:21:15,830 --> 00:21:16,830
for dereliction of duty!

477
00:21:16,830 --> 00:21:17,790
Feel free to ask

478
00:21:17,790 --> 00:21:19,100
any locals you want, My Lords.

479
00:21:19,100 --> 00:21:19,830
Then you will know

480
00:21:19,830 --> 00:21:21,000
if I made up anything!

481
00:21:21,000 --> 00:21:22,400
As for the responsibility
for dereliction of duty...

482
00:21:22,400 --> 00:21:24,030
I've long heard about the perception
and shrewdness

483
00:21:24,030 --> 00:21:25,030
of the Divine Constables in solving cases.

484
00:21:25,030 --> 00:21:25,890
Today, with you two

485
00:21:25,890 --> 00:21:27,030
Divine Constables here,

486
00:21:27,030 --> 00:21:28,440
won't the case be solved soon?

487
00:21:28,440 --> 00:21:30,510
And how can I be accused
of dereliction of duty?

488
00:21:30,510 --> 00:21:32,150
I really can't stand this. I...

489
00:21:32,150 --> 00:21:33,080
Where's my whip?

490
00:21:33,110 --> 00:21:34,590
I'll whip or hack you to death!

491
00:21:34,590 --> 00:21:36,110
-My Lord! My Lord!
-Stop right there!

492
00:21:36,110 --> 00:21:36,830
You terrible official!

493
00:21:36,830 --> 00:21:38,030
Master! Master!

494
00:21:38,200 --> 00:21:39,000
Divine Constables!

495
00:21:39,000 --> 00:21:40,240
I've brought Yin Baiquan here.

496
00:21:40,240 --> 00:21:40,550
Quick.

497
00:21:40,550 --> 00:21:41,010
Master.

498
00:21:41,030 --> 00:21:42,240
This is Yin Baiquan,
a body recovery worker.

499
00:21:42,240 --> 00:21:44,440
My Lords, ask him if you have any doubts.

500
00:21:44,720 --> 00:21:47,240
I'm Yin Baiquan, a body recovery worker.
Greetings, My Lords.

501
00:21:47,240 --> 00:21:48,220
Rise and speak.

502
00:21:50,240 --> 00:21:51,970
You are a body recovery worker?

503
00:21:52,110 --> 00:21:53,440
On the 28th of last month,

504
00:21:53,440 --> 00:21:54,720
some were murdered on Mount Hanhao.

505
00:21:54,720 --> 00:21:56,350
And five died on the 6th of this month.

506
00:21:56,350 --> 00:21:57,750
Did you collect all their bodies?

507
00:21:57,750 --> 00:21:58,750
Yes, I did.

508
00:21:58,750 --> 00:22:00,200
How many bodies in total?

509
00:22:00,310 --> 00:22:02,510
Including the four from Mount Hanhao,

510
00:22:02,510 --> 00:22:03,750
there are nine bodies in total.

511
00:22:03,750 --> 00:22:05,330
Nine bodies.

512
00:22:05,750 --> 00:22:07,050
Where are they now?

513
00:22:08,500 --> 00:22:10,070
Lady Constable Frost is asking you.

514
00:22:10,070 --> 00:22:11,550
Why are you looking at me?

515
00:22:12,550 --> 00:22:14,510
Since they were all from Yin Village,

516
00:22:14,510 --> 00:22:15,200
I chose to

517
00:22:15,220 --> 00:22:15,830
bury them

518
00:22:15,830 --> 00:22:17,100
in the village graveyard.

519
00:22:17,100 --> 00:22:19,760
This way, they were brought back
to their roots.

520
00:22:20,270 --> 00:22:21,130
Got it.

521
00:22:21,160 --> 00:22:23,690
I'll dig up the graves
and examine the bodies.

522
00:22:28,350 --> 00:22:28,960
My Lady,

523
00:22:28,960 --> 00:22:30,510
I'm afraid this is inappropriate.

524
00:22:30,510 --> 00:22:31,240
Zhao Quan!

525
00:22:31,640 --> 00:22:33,010
Lady Constable Frost
plans to examine the bodies,

526
00:22:33,010 --> 00:22:34,200
yet you're trying to stop her.

527
00:22:34,200 --> 00:22:35,000
Why?

528
00:22:35,110 --> 00:22:36,920
Do you mean to obstruct
the bureau's investigation of the case?

529
00:22:36,920 --> 00:22:37,880
I wouldn't dare.

530
00:22:37,920 --> 00:22:39,310
I wouldn't dare to do so.

531
00:22:39,550 --> 00:22:40,720
It's just that the graveyard

532
00:22:40,720 --> 00:22:41,810
is where the ancestors of Yin Village

533
00:22:41,810 --> 00:22:42,550
are buried.

534
00:22:42,550 --> 00:22:43,550
My concern

535
00:22:43,550 --> 00:22:44,470
is that the villagers

536
00:22:44,470 --> 00:22:46,020
will definitely think
the feng shui and luck

537
00:22:46,020 --> 00:22:47,550
are ruined if we dig up the graves.

538
00:22:47,550 --> 00:22:48,440
In a worst case scenario,

539
00:22:48,440 --> 00:22:49,650
they might try to fight us to death.

540
00:22:49,650 --> 00:22:50,440
If that happens,

541
00:22:50,440 --> 00:22:52,570
things will go completely out of hand.

542
00:22:52,920 --> 00:22:54,440
Public anger and resentment

543
00:22:54,440 --> 00:22:56,480
are like fierce floods and savage beasts.

544
00:22:56,480 --> 00:22:57,590
Don't you think the dignified

545
00:22:57,590 --> 00:22:58,510
Divine Constables know that?

546
00:22:58,510 --> 00:22:59,970
Cut it out, smarty-pants!

547
00:23:03,750 --> 00:23:04,920
Lady Constable Frost,

548
00:23:04,920 --> 00:23:06,180
what's your decision?

549
00:23:07,640 --> 00:23:09,880
Mr. Du, you manage the whole county.

550
00:23:09,920 --> 00:23:11,980
It is your duty to care for the people.

551
00:23:12,160 --> 00:23:13,200
What Zhao Quan just said

552
00:23:13,200 --> 00:23:14,310
does make sense.

553
00:23:14,920 --> 00:23:15,960
Given all that,

554
00:23:16,160 --> 00:23:18,550
I've decided not to examine the bodies.

555
00:23:24,270 --> 00:23:25,750
Who's there? Halt!

556
00:23:28,020 --> 00:23:28,830
Stop!

557
00:23:33,810 --> 00:23:38,500
[Golden Dragon Pavilion]

558
00:23:46,270 --> 00:23:47,070
Proceed.

559
00:23:49,270 --> 00:23:50,070
Keep moving.

560
00:23:52,000 --> 00:23:52,850
Off you go.

561
00:23:54,250 --> 00:23:55,220
Stop!

562
00:23:56,270 --> 00:23:57,580
Are you new to...

563
00:23:58,550 --> 00:23:59,530
Director Liu.

564
00:24:02,110 --> 00:24:03,940
Are the vegetables fresh today?

565
00:24:04,070 --> 00:24:04,920
Yes.

566
00:24:04,920 --> 00:24:06,580
Freshly picked this morning.

567
00:24:08,350 --> 00:24:09,160
Good.

568
00:24:09,240 --> 00:24:10,250
Go in then.

569
00:24:11,880 --> 00:24:14,140
[Golden Dragon Pavilion]

570
00:24:13,680 --> 00:24:14,510
Smarten up.

571
00:24:14,510 --> 00:24:15,570
Don't look around.

572
00:24:16,350 --> 00:24:17,630
One gold ingot

573
00:24:17,720 --> 00:24:19,350
for the deputy director's badge.

574
00:24:19,350 --> 00:24:20,610
It's a real bargain.

575
00:24:20,680 --> 00:24:21,750
Thanks, Xiaoshan.

576
00:24:22,160 --> 00:24:23,420
Stop right there!

577
00:24:25,310 --> 00:24:26,270
[Golden Dragon Pavilion]

578
00:24:25,510 --> 00:24:26,310
Stop!

579
00:24:27,310 --> 00:24:27,960
You stop there!

580
00:24:27,960 --> 00:24:29,020
Don't you run away!

581
00:24:29,510 --> 00:24:30,960
What are you looking at?

582
00:24:30,960 --> 00:24:31,310
Jiuying?

583
00:24:31,310 --> 00:24:31,960
Go inside and work!

584
00:24:31,960 --> 00:24:32,680
Why is it you?

585
00:24:32,680 --> 00:24:33,110
Get a move on!

586
00:24:33,110 --> 00:24:33,830
Let's go.

587
00:24:33,880 --> 00:24:35,110
I go wherever you go.

588
00:24:35,110 --> 00:24:35,880
Ridiculous!

589
00:24:36,070 --> 00:24:36,960
Who sent you here?

590
00:24:36,960 --> 00:24:37,920
Go back to where you set out from.

591
00:24:37,920 --> 00:24:38,640
I won't!

592
00:24:38,830 --> 00:24:39,750
Oh, kiddo...

593
00:24:39,770 --> 00:24:40,790
There are rules and regulations

594
00:24:40,790 --> 00:24:42,310
in the Divine Constable Bureau.

595
00:24:42,310 --> 00:24:43,220
Come here!

596
00:24:43,960 --> 00:24:44,750
Stop.

597
00:24:46,310 --> 00:24:47,310
By order of the general,

598
00:24:47,310 --> 00:24:48,510
nobody are allowed in except those

599
00:24:48,510 --> 00:24:50,160
working for the Golden Dragon Pavilion.

600
00:24:50,160 --> 00:24:51,750
His Highness Prince Ping
would like to station

601
00:24:51,750 --> 00:24:52,750
at the pavilion with a small troop.

602
00:24:52,750 --> 00:24:54,480
Please inform General Sui.

603
00:24:54,480 --> 00:24:55,680
I said no entry.

604
00:24:55,720 --> 00:24:57,030
And that means no entry.

605
00:24:57,030 --> 00:24:58,480
Informing the general won't help.

606
00:24:58,480 --> 00:24:58,960
Leave now!

607
00:24:58,960 --> 00:25:00,760
Who are you to deny them of entry?

608
00:25:01,510 --> 00:25:02,310
You stay put.

609
00:25:02,640 --> 00:25:03,570
Watch and learn.

610
00:25:04,750 --> 00:25:07,030
We all bear the duty
of protecting the royals.

611
00:25:07,030 --> 00:25:07,960
Better show some respect

612
00:25:07,960 --> 00:25:09,240
when it's needed.

613
00:25:11,680 --> 00:25:13,270
Open your eyes wide

614
00:25:12,110 --> 00:25:18,420
[Iron Constable]

615
00:25:13,270 --> 00:25:14,680
and look carefully.

616
00:25:14,750 --> 00:25:16,810
I am from the Divine Constable Bureau

617
00:25:16,960 --> 00:25:18,560
directly under His Majesty.

618
00:25:19,750 --> 00:25:21,880
Let's see which of you dares to stop me.

619
00:25:22,550 --> 00:25:23,620
Back off!

620
00:25:26,310 --> 00:25:28,110
Showing no respect, aren't you?

621
00:25:32,470 --> 00:25:33,800
Who else cares for a try?

622
00:25:33,880 --> 00:25:34,690
Lord Constable Iron,

623
00:25:34,690 --> 00:25:36,440
instead of performing your duties
in Tianhuang City,

624
00:25:35,770 --> 00:25:38,240
[Golden Dragon Pavilion]

625
00:25:36,750 --> 00:25:38,550
what are you doing here
at the Golden Dragon Pavilion?

626
00:25:38,550 --> 00:25:40,550
The Divine Constable Bureau is obligated

627
00:25:40,550 --> 00:25:42,960
to safeguard the Grand Heir Apparent.

628
00:25:43,030 --> 00:25:43,750
Xuanjie Battalion

629
00:25:43,750 --> 00:25:45,920
alone is enough to protect
the Grand Heir Apparent.

630
00:25:45,920 --> 00:25:46,920
Lord Constable Iron,

631
00:25:46,920 --> 00:25:47,750
please leave.

632
00:25:47,960 --> 00:25:49,440
Xuanjie Battalion

633
00:25:49,920 --> 00:25:53,350
is renowned as one
of the four major cavalries of Great Shi.

634
00:25:53,960 --> 00:25:55,360
But from what I see today,

635
00:25:56,550 --> 00:25:58,160
it's not that impressive.

636
00:25:58,750 --> 00:25:59,750
How is it supposed

637
00:25:59,750 --> 00:26:01,390
to shoulder the responsibility
of protecting

638
00:26:01,390 --> 00:26:03,520
the Grand Heir Apparent in the future?

639
00:26:03,920 --> 00:26:06,110
General Sui, have you forgotten

640
00:26:06,160 --> 00:26:07,490
the cities that Xuanjie Battalion lost

641
00:26:07,490 --> 00:26:08,560
years ago

642
00:26:08,750 --> 00:26:10,360
were actually recovered

643
00:26:10,480 --> 00:26:12,160
by Yulin Army?

644
00:26:12,920 --> 00:26:13,780
One should

645
00:26:13,920 --> 00:26:15,550
repay kindness with gratitude.

646
00:26:15,550 --> 00:26:16,310
How insolent!

647
00:26:16,310 --> 00:26:17,420
Did I say anything wrong?

648
00:26:17,420 --> 00:26:19,280
Please don't be mad, General Sui.

649
00:26:19,720 --> 00:26:21,440
I'm Constable Frost Bai Zhenzhu
from the Divine Constable Bureau.

650
00:26:21,440 --> 00:26:23,100
Greetings, General Sui Bing.

651
00:26:23,110 --> 00:26:24,180
You came

652
00:26:24,210 --> 00:26:25,740
in a crowd, didn't you?

653
00:26:26,510 --> 00:26:27,930
We all just want to do our part

654
00:26:27,930 --> 00:26:29,260
for the imperial court.

655
00:26:29,270 --> 00:26:31,350
Just now, Constable Iron
got a bit anxious.

656
00:26:31,350 --> 00:26:33,210
Please forgive him, General Sui.

657
00:26:33,720 --> 00:26:35,220
What a misunderstanding.

658
00:26:35,240 --> 00:26:36,970
It turns out we're all friends.

659
00:26:37,110 --> 00:26:38,170
Du Zhongtao?

660
00:26:38,720 --> 00:26:40,480
Mr. Du and General Sui

661
00:26:40,520 --> 00:26:41,820
are acquaintances?

662
00:26:43,160 --> 00:26:45,620
The general and I are
from the same hometown.

663
00:26:47,310 --> 00:26:48,070
Sui Bing,

664
00:26:48,070 --> 00:26:48,680
come on.

665
00:26:48,680 --> 00:26:50,270
My old friend, we're finally reunited.

666
00:26:50,270 --> 00:26:51,360
Let's go into the pavilion

667
00:26:51,360 --> 00:26:52,870
and do some catching up.

668
00:26:54,830 --> 00:26:56,030
Without my order,

669
00:26:56,070 --> 00:26:56,900
no one is allowed

670
00:26:56,900 --> 00:26:58,510
to enter or leave
the Golden Dragon Pavilion.

671
00:26:58,510 --> 00:27:00,420
Violators shall be executed.

672
00:27:01,160 --> 00:27:01,920
Yan.

673
00:27:02,160 --> 00:27:03,150
Please.

674
00:27:04,450 --> 00:27:06,820
[Golden Dragon Pavilion]

675
00:27:05,110 --> 00:27:06,160
Lord Yan, thank you

676
00:27:06,160 --> 00:27:07,070
for your help.

677
00:27:07,160 --> 00:27:08,350
It seems the general

678
00:27:08,750 --> 00:27:10,350
won't be able to enter this pavilion.

679
00:27:10,350 --> 00:27:12,510
I need to head back
and report to my superior.

680
00:27:12,510 --> 00:27:13,910
I will take my leave then.

681
00:27:14,160 --> 00:27:14,960
Goodbye.

682
00:27:16,420 --> 00:27:18,050
[Golden Dragon Pavilion]

683
00:27:18,510 --> 00:27:19,480
Zhenzhu!

684
00:27:20,270 --> 00:27:21,440
Jiuying.

685
00:27:21,510 --> 00:27:22,830
Why are you here?

686
00:27:22,920 --> 00:27:24,320
She must've sneaked out!

687
00:27:25,270 --> 00:27:26,110
I don't think

688
00:27:26,440 --> 00:27:27,440
we'll be able to shake off

689
00:27:27,440 --> 00:27:28,700
this little tagalong.

690
00:27:30,090 --> 00:27:31,350
Now that you're here, so be it.

691
00:27:31,350 --> 00:27:32,720
Another pair of hands is always useful.

692
00:27:32,720 --> 00:27:33,720
Be good, alright?

693
00:27:37,070 --> 00:27:41,610
[Golden Dragon Pavilion]

694
00:27:37,590 --> 00:27:38,400
Yan,

695
00:27:38,480 --> 00:27:39,160
when we go back,

696
00:27:39,160 --> 00:27:40,510
we need to really discuss how to gain

697
00:27:40,510 --> 00:27:42,070
access to the Golden Dragon Pavilion.

698
00:27:41,710 --> 00:27:45,230
[Department of Food Affairs]

699
00:28:10,640 --> 00:28:11,440
Keep moving.

700
00:28:13,510 --> 00:28:14,270
You're allowed in.

701
00:28:14,270 --> 00:28:15,240
Sui Bing is acting

702
00:28:15,240 --> 00:28:16,370
with great causion.

703
00:28:17,750 --> 00:28:18,510
Let's go.

704
00:28:19,830 --> 00:28:20,940
You saw that, right?

705
00:28:20,940 --> 00:28:24,380
[Department of Food Affairs]

706
00:28:21,160 --> 00:28:22,290
These soldiers were

707
00:28:22,310 --> 00:28:23,350
appointed by the imperial court

708
00:28:23,350 --> 00:28:24,960
to protect the Grand Heir Apparent.

709
00:28:24,960 --> 00:28:25,830
I heard

710
00:28:26,030 --> 00:28:28,030
that he's the Emperor's favorite grandson.

711
00:28:28,030 --> 00:28:28,680
Maybe

712
00:28:28,700 --> 00:28:30,500
he'll ascend the throne one day.

713
00:28:31,270 --> 00:28:32,040
If I hadn't

714
00:28:32,060 --> 00:28:33,160
brought you in today,

715
00:28:33,160 --> 00:28:34,560
you would probably never

716
00:28:34,720 --> 00:28:37,380
get a chance to see all of this
in your whole life.

717
00:28:38,830 --> 00:28:40,230
Xiaoshan, you really are

718
00:28:40,310 --> 00:28:41,350
a godsend to me.

719
00:28:51,680 --> 00:28:52,720
Then, Xiaosi,

720
00:28:53,830 --> 00:28:54,880
level with me.

721
00:28:55,270 --> 00:28:56,750
You just spent a fortune

722
00:28:56,750 --> 00:28:57,960
to get into the pavilion.

723
00:28:57,960 --> 00:28:59,350
What exactly is it for?

724
00:29:03,720 --> 00:29:04,510
Xiaoshan,

725
00:29:05,270 --> 00:29:07,160
since you treat me with sincerity,

726
00:29:07,160 --> 00:29:08,920
I might as well tell you the truth.

727
00:29:08,920 --> 00:29:09,780
In fact,

728
00:29:10,920 --> 00:29:12,830
my father has been ill for a long time.

729
00:29:12,830 --> 00:29:14,960
Suffering from the illness every day,

730
00:29:15,070 --> 00:29:15,920
he is

731
00:29:17,680 --> 00:29:18,920
in sheer agony.

732
00:29:21,750 --> 00:29:24,190
So you're here
for the Dragon Saliva Crystal?

733
00:29:24,190 --> 00:29:26,070
[Department of Food Affairs]

734
00:29:26,720 --> 00:29:27,510
Xiaoshan,

735
00:29:28,160 --> 00:29:29,560
do you have a way to get it?

736
00:29:29,750 --> 00:29:31,740
If you help me obtain the crystal,

737
00:29:31,920 --> 00:29:34,160
I'll be glad to off you

738
00:29:34,310 --> 00:29:35,350
all my wealth.

739
00:29:41,110 --> 00:29:42,750
Since I could bring you in...

740
00:29:42,940 --> 00:29:44,520
[Department of Food Affairs]

741
00:29:45,160 --> 00:29:46,160
I certainly am

742
00:29:46,750 --> 00:29:49,310
also able to help you attain the crystal.

743
00:29:50,310 --> 00:29:52,440
It is known to all
that I, Master Xiaoshan, am

744
00:29:52,440 --> 00:29:55,900
brave and wise, even with the capability
of holding up the sky.

745
00:29:56,350 --> 00:29:57,550
Sure, hold up the sky.

746
00:29:59,260 --> 00:30:00,070
Let's go.

747
00:30:03,490 --> 00:30:04,280
Get in.

748
00:30:04,310 --> 00:30:05,070
Come on.

749
00:30:10,510 --> 00:30:11,310
General!

750
00:30:12,880 --> 00:30:14,110
Sorry for my incompetence.

751
00:30:14,110 --> 00:30:15,480
Xuanjie Battalion got in the way,

752
00:30:15,480 --> 00:30:17,830
so we couldn't enter
the Golden Dragon Pavilion.

753
00:30:17,830 --> 00:30:19,310
That is no surprise.

754
00:30:21,830 --> 00:30:22,890
Announce my order:

755
00:30:23,440 --> 00:30:25,440
all shall camp outside the pavilion

756
00:30:25,680 --> 00:30:26,830
and be on high alert.

757
00:30:26,880 --> 00:30:27,680
Yes!

758
00:30:26,970 --> 00:30:31,690
[Yulin]

759
00:30:30,960 --> 00:30:31,750
General,

760
00:30:31,920 --> 00:30:33,030
you haven't slept for three days

761
00:30:33,030 --> 00:30:34,090
fand three nights.

762
00:30:34,240 --> 00:30:35,640
You should get some rest.

763
00:30:47,070 --> 00:30:48,730
I'm too worried to fall asleep

764
00:30:50,920 --> 00:30:52,580
at the thought of Ye's safety.

765
00:30:53,830 --> 00:30:54,660
Zexi,

766
00:30:55,430 --> 00:30:56,830
have you ever lost

767
00:30:58,350 --> 00:30:59,350
a loved one?

768
00:30:59,860 --> 00:31:01,410
The dead are gone forever.

769
00:31:01,430 --> 00:31:03,560
In accordance with the ancient rules,

770
00:31:03,680 --> 00:31:07,070
by public deliberation, the fourth prince
is granted the posthumous title

771
00:31:07,070 --> 00:31:08,350
of Prince Qi Huai.

772
00:31:08,350 --> 00:31:09,070
Father,

773
00:31:09,440 --> 00:31:10,350
my little brother Yan

774
00:31:09,950 --> 00:31:12,250
[Yu'an Hall]

775
00:31:10,440 --> 00:31:11,750
was murdered!

776
00:31:12,880 --> 00:31:13,680
Father,

777
00:31:13,960 --> 00:31:14,960
someone really did

778
00:31:14,960 --> 00:31:16,510
murder my brother Yan!

779
00:31:16,550 --> 00:31:18,550
Your Highness, please stop!

780
00:31:18,550 --> 00:31:19,810
-Father...
-Shut up!

781
00:31:20,030 --> 00:31:21,290
You rebellious child!

782
00:31:21,310 --> 00:31:22,240
You're spewing nonsense

783
00:31:22,240 --> 00:31:23,370
without restraint.

784
00:31:23,750 --> 00:31:25,790
Where is your decency
as a royal family member?

785
00:31:25,790 --> 00:31:26,700
Father,

786
00:31:27,550 --> 00:31:28,550
my little brother Yan

787
00:31:28,550 --> 00:31:30,880
was truly murdered by someone!

788
00:31:31,590 --> 00:31:32,400
Guards!

789
00:31:32,550 --> 00:31:34,160
-He was murdered! He was!
-Without my order,

790
00:31:34,160 --> 00:31:35,240
the third prince cannot

791
00:31:35,240 --> 00:31:36,960
step into Tianhuang City again!

792
00:31:36,960 --> 00:31:38,270
Your Highness.

793
00:31:38,980 --> 00:31:41,070
Father, you disregard
your bond with your son!

794
00:31:41,070 --> 00:31:43,330
My older brothers disregard their bond
with their sibling!

795
00:31:43,330 --> 00:31:45,240
Yan didn't die of illness at all!

796
00:31:45,260 --> 00:31:47,480
He was murdered by someone!

797
00:31:47,960 --> 00:31:49,640
He was murdered!

798
00:31:49,720 --> 00:31:51,750
He was murdered!

799
00:31:52,160 --> 00:31:54,580
He was murdered!

800
00:31:56,640 --> 00:31:57,830
As expected of the Great Shi

801
00:31:57,830 --> 00:32:00,030
imperial site for prayer and blessing.

802
00:32:00,270 --> 00:32:02,070
The beams are carved,
nd the rafters painted.

803
00:32:02,070 --> 00:32:03,530
What a spectacular place.

804
00:32:03,750 --> 00:32:05,070
How very magnificent.

805
00:32:05,440 --> 00:32:06,580
Xiaosi, with

806
00:32:06,610 --> 00:32:08,270
the deputy director's badge,

807
00:32:08,270 --> 00:32:09,640
you can access anywhere

808
00:32:09,720 --> 00:32:11,360
you want in the pavilion.

809
00:32:11,480 --> 00:32:13,480
You're free to go wherever you like.

810
00:32:14,590 --> 00:32:15,830
That said,

811
00:32:16,160 --> 00:32:17,550
I am new to this

812
00:32:17,550 --> 00:32:18,880
massive place.

813
00:32:19,720 --> 00:32:22,450
It takes some time
to familiarize myself with it.

814
00:32:24,510 --> 00:32:25,920
As long as you can identify

815
00:32:25,920 --> 00:32:27,880
the four main houses
in the east, west, south, and north,

816
00:32:27,880 --> 00:32:28,940
you won't get lost.

817
00:32:29,920 --> 00:32:31,120
Behind us

818
00:32:31,310 --> 00:32:32,770
is the Golden Dragon Hall,

819
00:32:32,920 --> 00:32:33,640
where

820
00:32:33,660 --> 00:32:35,720
the Golden Dragon God is worshipped.

821
00:32:35,720 --> 00:32:37,350
In front of it is a pond
containing holy water.

822
00:32:37,350 --> 00:32:39,510
It cures diseases and removes ill fortune.

823
00:32:39,510 --> 00:32:40,920
Facing it from afar

824
00:32:41,070 --> 00:32:42,160
is Tongtian Pavilion,

825
00:32:42,160 --> 00:32:44,160
which serves as the principal hall
of the Golden Dragon Pavilion.

826
00:32:44,160 --> 00:32:45,240
It is six stories high,

827
00:32:45,240 --> 00:32:46,350
about eighteen zhang.

828
00:32:46,350 --> 00:32:48,070
Climb it, and you'll reach
the heavenly realm

829
00:32:48,070 --> 00:32:50,730
and stand  shoulder to shoulder
with immortals.

830
00:32:53,160 --> 00:32:55,160
The building in the east
is named Fuguang Studio.

831
00:32:55,160 --> 00:32:57,720
It's said to be
where the master of the entire pavilion,

832
00:32:57,720 --> 00:32:59,120
Yun Hai, is in seclusion.

833
00:33:00,110 --> 00:33:02,310
Xiaoshan, have you seen Master Yun Hai?

834
00:33:02,440 --> 00:33:03,840
How could I have seen him?

835
00:33:04,160 --> 00:33:06,490
Yun Hai has been in seclusion
for 20 years.

836
00:33:06,550 --> 00:33:07,720
When he first started it,

837
00:33:07,720 --> 00:33:09,550
I was just born.

838
00:33:10,720 --> 00:33:11,680
Twenty years?

839
00:33:13,750 --> 00:33:14,880
What about the west?

840
00:33:15,830 --> 00:33:16,640
This is

841
00:33:16,530 --> 00:33:18,610
[Langyue Studio]

842
00:33:16,830 --> 00:33:18,830
the west pavilion, Langyue Studio.

843
00:33:19,030 --> 00:33:21,680
At first sight, I can already tell
it's extraordinary.

844
00:33:21,680 --> 00:33:23,740
No wonder General Sui Bing chose this

845
00:33:23,750 --> 00:33:25,160
as his dwelling place.

846
00:33:25,310 --> 00:33:26,240
Let's go now.

847
00:33:26,510 --> 00:33:28,270
We'll be scolded if the tea gets cold.

848
00:33:28,270 --> 00:33:29,920
You are now the deputy director.

849
00:33:29,920 --> 00:33:31,050
So you go first.

850
00:33:31,720 --> 00:33:32,600
[Deputy Director]

851
00:33:34,280 --> 00:33:35,550
Thanks, Xiaoshan.

852
00:33:35,450 --> 00:33:37,810
[Langyue Studio]

853
00:33:41,070 --> 00:33:42,040
Xiaoshan,

854
00:33:42,480 --> 00:33:43,750
so much has been said.

855
00:33:44,030 --> 00:33:45,390
But where exactly

856
00:33:45,410 --> 00:33:47,070
is the Dragon Saliva Crystal?

857
00:33:47,830 --> 00:33:48,910
Think about it.

858
00:33:49,440 --> 00:33:50,720
The Dragon Saliva Crystal

859
00:33:50,720 --> 00:33:52,830
was formed by the saliva
of the Golden Dragon.

860
00:33:52,830 --> 00:33:55,090
Of course it is in the Golden Dragon Hall.

861
00:33:56,370 --> 00:33:57,520
Hurry up and move.

862
00:34:03,070 --> 00:34:05,160
The Divine Constable Bureau is controlled
by relatives of royals.

863
00:34:05,160 --> 00:34:06,880
Xuanyuan Shan is just a woman.

864
00:34:06,880 --> 00:34:08,480
Can she be relied on
to safeguard the country?

865
00:34:08,480 --> 00:34:09,710
And that Iron Constable.

866
00:34:09,710 --> 00:34:10,880
Who does he think he is?

867
00:34:10,880 --> 00:34:11,480
You're right.

868
00:34:11,480 --> 00:34:13,070
How dare he challenge me?

869
00:34:13,110 --> 00:34:14,510
Without my order,

870
00:34:14,630 --> 00:34:16,020
Prince Ping has to stay outside

871
00:34:16,020 --> 00:34:17,320
the Golden Dragon Pavilion.

872
00:34:17,320 --> 00:34:17,880
Right.

873
00:34:17,880 --> 00:34:18,830
How can those people

874
00:34:18,830 --> 00:34:20,790
be compared to you, General?

875
00:34:20,920 --> 00:34:22,150
They are just

876
00:34:22,550 --> 00:34:24,679
jealous of your prestige, General,

877
00:34:24,880 --> 00:34:26,710
and fishing for fame.

878
00:34:27,400 --> 00:34:28,190
Sui Bing,

879
00:34:28,230 --> 00:34:30,840
calm down. Don't be mad.

880
00:34:31,280 --> 00:34:32,280
My Lords, please

881
00:34:32,880 --> 00:34:34,150
have some tea and snacks.

882
00:34:34,150 --> 00:34:36,030
Come on, Sui Bing. Let's enjoy the tea.

883
00:34:36,030 --> 00:34:37,920
If it weren't for the defeat
on the northern border,

884
00:34:37,920 --> 00:34:39,710
how would I have been reduced
to this state

885
00:34:39,710 --> 00:34:41,170
and humiliated like that?

886
00:34:41,840 --> 00:34:43,989
The soldiers of Xuanjie Battalion
fought hard for over a month

887
00:34:43,989 --> 00:34:45,550
and killed countless enemies.

888
00:34:45,550 --> 00:34:47,000
But in the end, it was Prince Ping who

889
00:34:47,000 --> 00:34:48,130
took all the credit.

890
00:34:48,920 --> 00:34:51,199
That happened
because you are an incompetent

891
00:34:51,199 --> 00:34:53,130
and arrogant military commander.

892
00:34:53,550 --> 00:34:54,880
The two of you may leave.

893
00:34:55,630 --> 00:34:56,440
Yes.

894
00:34:58,960 --> 00:34:59,890
Sui Bing,

895
00:34:59,960 --> 00:35:01,050
have you heard

896
00:35:01,080 --> 00:35:03,110
that the Dragon Saliva Crystal
can cure all diseases

897
00:35:03,110 --> 00:35:04,840
and bring the dead back to life?

898
00:35:04,920 --> 00:35:06,920
If you attain this treasure, General,

899
00:35:06,920 --> 00:35:08,710
and gift it to His Highness Prince Ding,

900
00:35:08,710 --> 00:35:10,350
the prince will surely present it
to the Emperor.

901
00:35:10,350 --> 00:35:11,710
When His Majesty recovers,

902
00:35:11,710 --> 00:35:13,630
you will be the one
with the greatest merit.

903
00:35:13,630 --> 00:35:16,180
No need to fear you can't
rise again, right?

904
00:35:17,410 --> 00:35:19,830
[Gutan County Government]

905
00:35:20,550 --> 00:35:21,280
My Lords,

906
00:35:21,280 --> 00:35:22,360
these are the county annals,

907
00:35:22,360 --> 00:35:23,880
the case files from previous years,

908
00:35:23,880 --> 00:35:25,330
and the household registrations
of all villages

909
00:35:25,330 --> 00:35:25,920
that you asked for.

910
00:35:25,920 --> 00:35:27,480
These documents record the victims

911
00:35:27,480 --> 00:35:28,220
murdered in the two

912
00:35:28,220 --> 00:35:29,150
shadow puppet cases.

913
00:35:29,150 --> 00:35:30,070
Here are the travel permits

914
00:35:30,070 --> 00:35:30,960
we found on them.

915
00:35:30,370 --> 00:35:32,340
[Anren County Pass]

916
00:35:30,960 --> 00:35:32,150
Good, thank you for your hard work.

917
00:35:32,150 --> 00:35:32,920
Your Highness, this way.

918
00:35:32,920 --> 00:35:34,050
They're right here.

919
00:35:36,940 --> 00:35:43,210
[Law Enforced Impartially]

920
00:35:39,360 --> 00:35:40,150
We are...

921
00:35:40,230 --> 00:35:41,150
Constable Frost Bai Zhenzhu.

922
00:35:41,150 --> 00:35:42,230
Iron Constable Yan Cheng.

923
00:35:42,230 --> 00:35:44,430
Greetings, Your Highness Prince Ping.

924
00:35:44,510 --> 00:35:45,970
Get up already, officers.

925
00:35:47,840 --> 00:35:49,170
Is my abrupt appearance

926
00:35:49,840 --> 00:35:51,840
interrupting your investigation?

927
00:35:52,920 --> 00:35:53,920
I told His Highness

928
00:35:53,920 --> 00:35:55,190
about your visit to Gutan County.

929
00:35:55,190 --> 00:35:55,880
Besides,

930
00:35:55,880 --> 00:35:57,880
the rumors about the shadow puppet ghost
are widely spread.

931
00:35:57,880 --> 00:35:59,230
So, the general figured

932
00:35:59,480 --> 00:36:00,280
that you must be

933
00:36:00,280 --> 00:36:01,840
investigating this case.

934
00:36:02,150 --> 00:36:03,670
This case is too strange.

935
00:36:03,760 --> 00:36:04,840
It directly concerns

936
00:36:04,840 --> 00:36:06,230
the upcoming blessing ceremony

937
00:36:06,230 --> 00:36:07,550
and Ye's safety.

938
00:36:08,550 --> 00:36:09,920
I cannot ignore it.

939
00:36:13,920 --> 00:36:14,880
Officers,

940
00:36:16,150 --> 00:36:17,480
I wonder if I can join you

941
00:36:18,230 --> 00:36:19,490
in the investigation.

942
00:36:28,110 --> 00:36:29,010
Li Si!

943
00:36:31,440 --> 00:36:32,440
What did you find?

944
00:36:33,360 --> 00:36:35,920
I saw Zhenzhu and Mr. Yan

945
00:36:35,920 --> 00:36:37,320
enter the county office.

946
00:36:40,030 --> 00:36:41,360
Let me guess.

947
00:36:41,710 --> 00:36:43,040
Besides the two of them,

948
00:36:43,280 --> 00:36:44,610
there was someone else—

949
00:36:46,230 --> 00:36:47,360
Prince Ping.

950
00:36:48,880 --> 00:36:50,740
How did you figure that out again?

951
00:36:51,670 --> 00:36:53,870
Since Prince Ping has arrived in Gutan,

952
00:36:53,960 --> 00:36:55,340
he must have heard about the killings

953
00:36:55,340 --> 00:36:57,140
done by the shadow puppet ghost.

954
00:36:57,510 --> 00:36:59,510
This matter concerns the safety
of the Grand Heir Apparent.

955
00:36:59,510 --> 00:37:00,960
Of course he is worried.

956
00:37:01,510 --> 00:37:02,920
Where else could he have gone,

957
00:37:02,920 --> 00:37:04,580
if not the magistrate office?

958
00:37:07,550 --> 00:37:08,760
Kiddo, when did you

959
00:37:09,150 --> 00:37:10,710
learn to flatter others?

960
00:37:18,030 --> 00:37:19,030
What is this?

961
00:37:19,920 --> 00:37:21,120
This is a paper cutout

962
00:37:21,150 --> 00:37:23,480
that the locals use to imitate
shadow puppets

963
00:37:23,480 --> 00:37:24,840
and amuse children.

964
00:37:26,800 --> 00:37:27,760
At this point,

965
00:37:29,510 --> 00:37:31,610
it's time to let people see

966
00:37:31,760 --> 00:37:34,000
what a fairy dream is really like.

967
00:37:42,280 --> 00:37:43,070
Jiuying.

968
00:37:44,710 --> 00:37:46,370
Here are four treasure notes.

969
00:37:46,670 --> 00:37:47,880
Complete a task for me

970
00:37:47,920 --> 00:37:49,490
with these three.

971
00:37:49,550 --> 00:37:50,550
After it's done,

972
00:37:50,840 --> 00:37:51,630
this note

973
00:37:51,920 --> 00:37:52,920
will be yours.

974
00:37:54,360 --> 00:37:55,290
What's the task?

975
00:38:02,030 --> 00:38:03,230
Rest assured, Li Si.

976
00:38:03,250 --> 00:38:04,910
I will definitely get it done.

977
00:38:07,550 --> 00:38:08,950
This fuzzy kiddo has even

978
00:38:09,440 --> 00:38:11,370
learned to take money from others.

979
00:38:11,460 --> 00:38:14,070
[Xiangrui Shadow Puppet Shop]

980
00:38:18,480 --> 00:38:20,070
Feel free to browse around.

981
00:38:21,630 --> 00:38:22,440
You're a girl?

982
00:38:23,630 --> 00:38:25,490
Do you want to buy shadow puppets?

983
00:38:32,910 --> 00:38:33,780
[Great Shi Treasure Notes]

984
00:38:37,230 --> 00:38:38,280
What a large sum of money.

985
00:38:38,280 --> 00:38:40,150
What kind of shadow puppet would you like?

986
00:38:40,150 --> 00:38:41,820
Li Si told me to buy

987
00:38:41,920 --> 00:38:43,360
the ugliest

988
00:38:43,380 --> 00:38:44,360
and scariest ones.

989
00:38:44,360 --> 00:38:45,960
I'll take as many as you have.

990
00:38:46,760 --> 00:38:47,550
Got it.

991
00:39:03,550 --> 00:39:04,840
Investigating a case

992
00:39:04,920 --> 00:39:07,120
with no physical evidence or witnesses

993
00:39:07,280 --> 00:39:09,360
is really killing me.

994
00:39:10,510 --> 00:39:11,320
Yan.

995
00:39:14,320 --> 00:39:15,760
I also feel that investigating cases

996
00:39:15,760 --> 00:39:17,070
nd collecting evidence

997
00:39:17,070 --> 00:39:17,920
are not at all easier

998
00:39:17,920 --> 00:39:20,320
than leading troops and fighting battles.

999
00:39:20,960 --> 00:39:22,160
You got any findings?

1000
00:39:22,360 --> 00:39:23,820
Let's pool them together.

1001
00:39:24,710 --> 00:39:25,970
Lady Constable Frost.

1002
00:39:27,150 --> 00:39:28,450
In the first murder case,

1003
00:39:28,450 --> 00:39:29,550
the four victims

1004
00:39:29,550 --> 00:39:30,710
were two couples

1005
00:39:30,960 --> 00:39:31,960
in their thirties.

1006
00:39:31,960 --> 00:39:34,820
They were all herb gatherers
living in Yin Village.

1007
00:39:34,840 --> 00:39:36,350
Given that their bodies were found

1008
00:39:36,350 --> 00:39:37,960
on Mount Hanhao at the same time,

1009
00:39:37,960 --> 00:39:39,110
hung like shadow puppets

1010
00:39:39,110 --> 00:39:40,360
on the same tree

1011
00:39:40,360 --> 00:39:41,920
with herb baskets on their backs,

1012
00:39:41,920 --> 00:39:43,550
it can be inferred that they probably

1013
00:39:43,550 --> 00:39:45,440
went to the mountain
as a team to gather herbs

1014
00:39:45,440 --> 00:39:46,960
on the 28th of last month.

1015
00:39:47,070 --> 00:39:49,710
Then, they were killed
by the shadow puppet ghost.

1016
00:39:49,710 --> 00:39:51,710
The household registration records show

1017
00:39:51,710 --> 00:39:53,030
that these two families lived close.

1018
00:39:53,030 --> 00:39:54,550
They should be acquaintances.

1019
00:39:54,550 --> 00:39:55,550
So, I am thinking

1020
00:39:55,550 --> 00:39:57,360
that the murderer could be

1021
00:39:57,360 --> 00:39:58,960
someone they both knew

1022
00:39:58,960 --> 00:40:01,070
or a villager from Yin Village.

1023
00:40:01,320 --> 00:40:02,720
As for the second murder,

1024
00:40:02,960 --> 00:40:04,670
it happened on the 6th of this month.

1025
00:40:04,670 --> 00:40:05,760
There were five

1026
00:40:06,550 --> 00:40:07,350
male victims,

1027
00:40:07,550 --> 00:40:09,810
aged between 20 and 45.

1028
00:40:10,030 --> 00:40:13,070
They were Yin Changrong,
a butcher from Yin Village,

1029
00:40:13,280 --> 00:40:15,610
Kong Jiqing, a fur merchant
from Yuezhou,

1030
00:40:15,680 --> 00:40:17,480
Duan Jiang, a carpenter
from Lin County,

1031
00:40:17,480 --> 00:40:19,480
Kan Ning, a traveler from Caozhou,

1032
00:40:19,840 --> 00:40:20,840
and Jia Sheng,

1033
00:40:20,860 --> 00:40:23,110
a staffer at Changlai Steamed Bun Shop.

1034
00:40:23,320 --> 00:40:24,580
Among the five of them,

1035
00:40:24,630 --> 00:40:26,030
Yin Changrong and Jia Sheng

1036
00:40:26,030 --> 00:40:27,360
were from Gutan County.

1037
00:40:27,960 --> 00:40:29,360
The remaining three

1038
00:40:29,550 --> 00:40:30,950
were all from out of town.

1039
00:40:31,070 --> 00:40:32,470
Based on what we have now,

1040
00:40:32,550 --> 00:40:34,550
these people had nothing to do
with each other.

1041
00:40:34,550 --> 00:40:36,350
And they didn't know each other.

1042
00:40:36,360 --> 00:40:38,180
Did the murderer choose

1043
00:40:39,150 --> 00:40:40,670
his targets at random?

1044
00:40:42,960 --> 00:40:44,620
Changlai Steamed Bun Shop...

1045
00:40:45,830 --> 00:40:48,210
[Changlai Steamed Bun Shop, Food Market,
West Fair of Gutan County]

1046
00:40:46,510 --> 00:40:48,030
I was wondering why the name

1047
00:40:48,030 --> 00:40:49,840
sounds so familiar.

1048
00:40:48,270 --> 00:40:50,690
[Changlai Steamed Bun Shop]

1049
00:40:50,230 --> 00:40:51,280
This bun shop...

1050
00:40:51,480 --> 00:40:52,280
-Gui!
-Lady Bai and I

1051
00:40:52,280 --> 00:40:53,710
-almost got in there.
-Don't go in there.

1052
00:40:53,710 --> 00:40:55,920
No wonder it looks so strange

1053
00:40:56,550 --> 00:40:58,010
that no one dares to get in.

1054
00:40:58,030 --> 00:40:59,450
Now that I think about it,

1055
00:40:59,710 --> 00:41:00,960
people probably know

1056
00:41:01,280 --> 00:41:03,630
a staffer there was killed
by a vengeful ghost.

1057
00:41:03,630 --> 00:41:04,890
Nobody would want to be

1058
00:41:05,280 --> 00:41:07,610
associated with that kind of misfortune.

1059
00:41:08,510 --> 00:41:09,840
I also found something.

1060
00:41:11,710 --> 00:41:13,150
According to the county annals,

1061
00:41:13,150 --> 00:41:14,960
the shadow puppetry art of Gutan County

1062
00:41:14,940 --> 00:41:16,090
[Zhang Deshan, aged 45,
a citizen and a farmer]

1063
00:41:15,070 --> 00:41:16,960
can be traced back
to more than 200 years ago.

1064
00:41:16,120 --> 00:41:17,930
[His wife, surnamed Wang, aged 42]
[His daughter, Zhang Er'niang, aged12]

1065
00:41:17,110 --> 00:41:19,000
The lifelike puppets

1066
00:41:18,030 --> 00:41:18,280
[Chen Wenyuan, aged 32,
a citizen, an organizer]

1067
00:41:19,000 --> 00:41:20,200
and excellent skills

1068
00:41:20,320 --> 00:41:23,320
won the art a reputation
of "Fairy Dream."

1069
00:41:23,230 --> 00:41:29,270
[Commanding Yet Not Haughty]

1070
00:41:23,550 --> 00:41:25,630
Nowadays, many families in Gutan County

1071
00:41:25,630 --> 00:41:27,710
have made a living
by producing shadow puppets

1072
00:41:27,710 --> 00:41:29,880
and performing shadow plays
for generations.

1073
00:41:29,880 --> 00:41:32,150
There is a remark in the records,
"when the Fairy Dream's on,"

1074
00:41:32,150 --> 00:41:35,350
"all streets are empty
for people have flocked to see it."

1075
00:41:35,360 --> 00:41:36,360
No wonder

1076
00:41:36,550 --> 00:41:38,470
even a murder case in this place

1077
00:41:38,500 --> 00:41:39,690
seems so bizarre.

1078
00:41:40,150 --> 00:41:41,030
I found

1079
00:41:41,150 --> 00:41:42,880
something highly suspicious.

1080
00:41:43,230 --> 00:41:44,550
Among the nine victims,

1081
00:41:44,550 --> 00:41:46,480
there were young and middle-aged people,

1082
00:41:46,480 --> 00:41:48,150
all in their prime.

1083
00:41:48,440 --> 00:41:50,070
Seven of them were male,

1084
00:41:50,070 --> 00:41:51,800
who wouldn't be easily killed.

1085
00:41:51,840 --> 00:41:52,710
How exactly

1086
00:41:52,740 --> 00:41:53,880
did the murderer

1087
00:41:54,110 --> 00:41:55,280
manage to take so many lives

1088
00:41:55,280 --> 00:41:56,320
at the same time?

1089
00:41:56,550 --> 00:41:57,960
And he chose to dispose of

1090
00:41:57,960 --> 00:41:59,320
the bodies in a time-consuming

1091
00:41:59,320 --> 00:42:00,550
and laborious way.

1092
00:42:01,630 --> 00:42:03,670
He who is able to do both...

1093
00:42:04,320 --> 00:42:05,960
If it were not a ghost...

1094
00:42:06,880 --> 00:42:07,630
That means

1095
00:42:07,650 --> 00:42:09,440
the murderer had helpers.

1096
00:42:11,150 --> 00:42:13,070
Let's say the killings
were done by a group.

1097
00:42:13,070 --> 00:42:16,030
Why would they kill these many people

1098
00:42:16,480 --> 00:42:17,150
and then

1099
00:42:17,150 --> 00:42:18,840
go to such great lengths

1100
00:42:18,840 --> 00:42:20,150
to hang the bodies up?

1101
00:42:20,440 --> 00:42:22,640
Could these killers have all gone crazy

1102
00:42:23,230 --> 00:42:25,320
for watching too many puppet plays
so they decided

1103
00:42:25,320 --> 00:42:26,520
to imitate the plots?

1104
00:42:30,660 --> 00:42:32,130
[Law Enforced Impartially]

1105
00:42:31,070 --> 00:42:32,510
This might explain it.

1106
00:42:33,230 --> 00:42:34,960
Here is a file from six years ago

1107
00:42:35,070 --> 00:42:36,400
about the shadow puppet ghost

1108
00:42:36,400 --> 00:42:37,280
dreaded by the people.

1109
00:42:36,540 --> 00:42:37,850
[Murder committed by Yin Jie,
shadow puppet artist]

1110
00:42:37,280 --> 00:42:38,150
He was named Yin Jie.

1111
00:42:37,850 --> 00:42:39,170
[from Yin Village, Gutan County]

1112
00:42:38,150 --> 00:42:40,080
Please take a look, Your Highness.

1113
00:42:40,550 --> 00:42:41,440
Now, it seems

1114
00:42:41,670 --> 00:42:42,590
the killer is imitating

1115
00:42:42,590 --> 00:42:44,030
the murder methods from back then,

1116
00:42:44,030 --> 00:42:45,460
and trying to pin the blame

1117
00:42:45,460 --> 00:42:46,900
on Yin Jie.

1118
00:42:47,320 --> 00:42:48,350
This way, those who don't know
the truth

1119
00:42:48,350 --> 00:42:50,070
will associate it
with the shadow puppet murders

1120
00:42:50,070 --> 00:42:52,230
and are deterred
from investigating this case.

1121
00:42:52,230 --> 00:42:53,540
Yin Jie the murderer

1122
00:42:53,760 --> 00:42:55,420
fell to his death from the peak

1123
00:42:55,710 --> 00:42:57,170
of Mount Hanhao at the back

1124
00:42:57,480 --> 00:43:00,410
of the Golden Dragon Pavilion
to avoid being caught.

1125
00:43:01,710 --> 00:43:03,240
Such is the way of the world.

1126
00:43:03,550 --> 00:43:04,880
Evil people do evil things.

1127
00:43:04,880 --> 00:43:05,710
But good people

1128
00:43:05,710 --> 00:43:07,370
shouldn't be bullied, right?

1129
00:43:08,320 --> 00:43:09,480
Maybe I shouldn't say this,

1130
00:43:09,480 --> 00:43:11,480
but Yin Jie was such a wretched soul.

